0.17.0
• Expanded the public API with atomic named-list creation and batch item addition.
• Added optional set, trait, quality, level, and Champion Point matching overrides for integrations.
• Added explicit list-name conflict handling, stable API v2 errors, and failing-item indexes.
• Added checksummed SL2 sharing for item links, notes, matching rules, and price targets while retaining SL1 imports.
• Kept API v1 item addition and active-list discovery compatible.

0.16.4
• Added complete Spanish and French localizations with English fallback.
• Corrected localization files not loading because ESO manifests do not expand wildcard paths.
• Kept the main list selector label independent from the item-filter dropdown.
• Prevented runtime-only SavedVariables metadata from invalidating full backup generation.

0.16.3
• Added a versioned public API that allows other add-ons to add linked or name-only items to active shopping lists.
• Added safe list discovery, current-list defaults, optional notes, and stable API error codes.
• Added developer integration documentation and ESOUI-ready BBCode examples.
• Distinguished same-named weapon, armor, and jewelry traits in item-editor dropdowns.
• Renamed the manifest and Lua namespaces to GravvyShoppingList to avoid Master Merchant's legacy ShoppingList importer warning.

0.16.2
• Added an option to add linked chat items to the current shopping list from their right-click menu.

0.16.1
• Restored the Trait, Quality Rule, Quality, and Level Rule dropdowns in the keyboard item editor.
• Corrected Craft Bag quantities by enumerating virtual bag slots with their sparse slot IDs.

0.16.0
• Added live owned quantities from the backpack, bank, subscriber bank, and craft bag without changing purchase progress.
• Added persistent notes for lists and individual items.
• Added full-data SLB1 backup and restore codes while keeping lightweight SL1 list-sharing codes unchanged.
• Added font scaling, stronger contrast, and optional non-color-only status indicators.
• Added keyboard and gamepad workflows for notes and full-data backup and restore.

0.15.4
• Completed gamepad list management with create, rename, duplicate, delete, reorder, budget, and clear-completed actions.
• Added persistent Undo for deleted items, deleted lists, and batches cleared with Clear Completed.
• Added bulk item entry with support for pasted item and quantity lines.
• Added All, Needed, Completed, Over Price Target, and Rule-Restricted item filters.
• Added optional merged shopping trips across selected active lists while keeping inactive lists untouched.
• Kept the mouse cursor active after closing the item-removal confirmation while the shopping list remains open.
• Corrected the Active Shopping Lists description layout so the full text wraps inside the window.
• Restored the shopping-list cursor when returning to ESO after switching to another application.

0.15.3
• Minor bug fixes and improvements.

0.15.2
• Added an in-game chat warning that names any required libraries that are missing.

0.15.1
• Lists can now be archived whether they are unfinished, completed, or empty.
• Corrected the Archive button appearing unresponsive for unfinished lists.

0.15.0
• Added in-game help and recent release notes for keyboard and gamepad.
• Added the /shoppinglisthelp command and a ? button in the main window.

0.14.0
• Added the gamepad Manage menu.
• Added controller editing for matching rules and price targets.
• Added controller archive, restore, share, and import workflows.

0.13.6
• Corrected Import dialog layering above the Share window.

0.13.5
• Added the optional NA-only in-game donation-mail shortcut.

0.13.4
• Added a dedicated import paste dialog and item-removal confirmation.
